WEBVTT

00:13:29.448 --> 00:13:30.767
This is our spaceship,

00:13:30.767 --> 00:13:31.874
the Soyuz, that little one.

00:13:31.874 --> 00:13:33.339
Three of us climb in,

00:13:33.339 --> 00:13:35.791
and then this spaceship detaches from the station

00:13:35.791 --> 00:13:37.461
and falls into the atmosphere.

00:13:37.461 --> 00:13:39.083
These two parts here

00:13:39.083 --> 00:13:41.247
actually melt, we jettison them and they burn up

00:13:41.247 --> 00:13:42.329
in the atmosphere.

00:13:42.329 --> 00:13:44.582
The only part that survives is the little bullet

00:13:44.582 --> 00:13:45.758
that we're riding in,

00:13:45.758 --> 00:13:47.796
and it falls into the atmosphere,

00:13:47.796 --> 00:13:49.372
and in essence

00:13:49.372 --> 00:13:52.933
you are riding a meteorite home,

00:13:52.933 --> 00:13:55.866
and riding meteorites is scary,

00:13:55.866 --> 00:13:57.379
and it ought to be.

00:13:57.379 --> 00:13:59.618
But instead of riding into the atmosphere

00:13:59.618 --> 00:14:00.856
just screaming, like you would